type: software
title: "WristXR: free VR desktop overlay with wrist clock for SteamVR"
abstract: "Free, open-source SteamVR overlay for Windows and Linux: desktop screens and windows in VR with a laser pointer, a two-hand VR keyboard, a VRChat chatbox keyboard, Discord notifications and a wrist watch with time, controller batteries, music controls and frame rate."
authors:
